{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And you shall bake it</b> — in gematria: like the shape of an open box (תבה פרוצה), and gematria: a dancing ship (ספינה רקדת). In the Bread of the Presence: 24 tenths, and they are 12 loaves corresponding to the 12 zodiac signs that rotate cyclically through the 24 hours of the day, and they are six sets of six, corresponding to the six days of Creation in which the world was created — all sustained through the merit of Israel."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:25.421224191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}